{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's harder than it looks</strong> - A relaxing, stressful, satisfying, and infuriating game where you need to push shapes into a hole. Don't let the simplicity deceive you. It's not as easy as it sounds. 17 shapes on the screen means game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing and Stressful, Satisfying and Infuriating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique physics makes the game challenging, while the simple design and the satisfying sound effects keep the game relaxing. And the mixture of these two creates a somewhat addicting experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Consumables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Heart_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Lightning_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Paw_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Smiley_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Star_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ring and buy consumable boosts with in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currency is earned every time you push a diamond into the hole. The game is designed to make attaining and spending currency balanced in a way that keeps the game fun and avoids grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although everything can be done without spending a single penny, in-app purchases are available for cosmetics for people who would rather customize their ring without using in-game currency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard and Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game integrates directly with Steam Leaderboard and Steam Stats to give you the best competitive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737090?t=1762660535","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737090?t=1762660535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/a07d1fe7e963248eda8ffc0e37a3d4e394fb49b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762660535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/a07d1fe7e963248eda8ffc0e37a3d4e394fb49b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762660535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's harder than it looks</strong> - A relaxing, stressful, satisfying, and infuriating game where you need to push shapes into a hole. Don't let the simplicity deceive you. It's not as easy as it sounds. 17 shapes on the screen means game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing and Stressful, Satisfying and Infuriating</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique physics makes the game challenging, while the simple design and the satisfying sound effects keep the game relaxing. And the mixture of these two creates a somewhat addicting experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization and Consumables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Heart_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Lightning_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Paw_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Smiley_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737090/extras/Star_Ring.png?t=1762660535\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ring and buy consumable boosts with in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currency is earned every time you push a diamond into the hole. The game is designed to make attaining and spending currency balanced in a way that keeps the game fun and avoids grind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although everything can be done without spending a single penny, in-app purchases are available for cosmetics for people who would rather customize their ring without using in-game currency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard and Stats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game integrates directly with Steam Leaderboard and Steam Stats to give you the best competitive experience.</p>","developers":["Gozar Productions LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store